  *
  * @RKISP2_FEATURE_DUAL_CROP: The ISP has the dual crop block at the resizer input
  * @RKISP2_FEATURE_ACK_FRM_PRO: SWS_CFG has the frame process acknowledge disable bit
+ * @RKISP2_FEATURE_IS_CROP: The ISP has the output crop of the image stabiliser
+ * @RKISP2_FEATURE_NOC_HURRY: The ISP control register sets the bus priorities
+ * @RKISP2_FEATURE_RAWRD_SWAP: The raw readback swaps the words of unpacked samples
